WEBVTT

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.150
A long time ago,

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:37.690
there were eight Sages who worked together with Sougen,

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:40.510
the first Emperor of Saiunkoku, to establish the country.

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:47.090
The sages, who were known as the Sai Hassen,
disappeared from the palace after Sougen's death.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:51.170
Only the residence created for the Sages by order of the first Emperor remains.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:53.370
It is known as the Sendou-kyuu.

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:55.840
According to the historical records,

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:59.970
the Sai Hassen will gather again in the Sendou-kyuu,

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:02.780
when an Emperor befitting them arises.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:13.320
Sashuu official Tei Yuushun has arrived.

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:38.160
I'd like to thank you again,

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:41.840
for supporting Sashuu during the last ten years.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.560
Please convey my sincere gratitude to all officials in Sashuu.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.560
You've become a good emperor.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.190
You were angry at my enthronement.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:01.200
Yes, very much so. I'm glad you got back on course.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.700
You've worked hard, my Lord.

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:07.960
I thought you would tell me off.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.370
I'll have plenty of opportunity to do so from now on.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:12.990
Be prepared for that.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:23.500
You've already made an informal agreement.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.500
Thank you for going through so much trouble for this.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.150
It should work fine as a bluff, so please sign the document.

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:33.660
Please come back any time you like.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.690
I'll leave the position of Prime Minister open until then.

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.910
You're appointing me as Prime Minister?

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:42.820
That's an enormous advance in my career.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:48.000
Neither in Civil Affairs nor the Treasury are there ministers who will listen to me.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:52.700
That's true. It requires a bit of "know-how."

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.460
You must tell me that "know-how" in secret later!

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.840
Are you sure you want me to do that?

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:08.480
I understand at last why my father kept silent about Sashuu for the last ten years.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:13.960
My father was waiting for the moment when Sashuu would be restored to peace,

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.280
and a new Prime Minister could be brought forward.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:19.320
Yes, for the next Imperial prince who would succeed to the throne.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:26.990
The previous emperor told me I had to return alive for that.

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:31.780
Even my father couldn't have imagined that I'd be the one.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:38.320
The measures you took for Ensei, and appointment of new governors to Sashuu, were your decisions.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.580
You handled both extremely well.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:49.340
I would like once again to celebrate my lord's enthronement.

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:55.520
Once Sashuu is at peace, I promise to return for you.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:05:00.760
I pledge my loyalty to my kind and strong-willed lord.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:06.700
Even if the Kou and Ran families rise in revolt against you,

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.790
I will remain in your service.

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:29.330
Father, you're home already?

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.510
Ah yes, I'm home, Shuurei.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.070
Uncle Kurou...

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:35.880
Thank you for coming.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:42.310
The expression on Kurou's face is as rare as a national treasure.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.320
Are you going out, Shuurei?

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:48.070
Well yes, that was my intention.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:51.550
Oh, no problem. I can serve the tea myself.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:55.040
I-I will prepare the tea immediately.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:06:00.750
Don't worry about it. I know brother Shou.

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:02.550
You should go if you're in a rush.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.350
Uncle...

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:08.930
Thank you very much for the official notice the other day.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.220
You've worked hard.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:14.980
No...

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.730
I said, you've worked hard.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:19.850
Yes.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:22.250
A souvenir for you.

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:27.290
Mandarins!

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:28.980
They look delicious.

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:31.110
They are the famous mandarins of Koushuu.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:34.230
They were your favorites when you used to live in the mansion in Koushuu.

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:35.740
Is that so?

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:39.450
Come to think of it, Kurou came quite often to give her mandarins.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:53.070
Perhaps that's the reason Reishin always picks a quarrel with Kurou.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.800
Take some if you're going somewhere.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.060
Yes, thank you very much.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:01.520
I'm off now.

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:05.450
Be careful.

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:16.820
I know brother Rei came by.

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:22.810
Kurou...

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:23.350
Yes?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.720
It's not like you to jump to conclusions.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:28.800
I'm not.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.780
Reishin and I looked through all the marriage proposals.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:34.210
That's enough for now.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:36.550
I think you should take them home.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.180
Shuurei knows nothing about it, does she?

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.720
She's returning to Sashuu soon.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:44.550
There's no point in telling her now.

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:50.710
On top of that, she'll definitely reject all of them if we show them to her.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.700
She doesn't want a political marriage?

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.700
No, the problem is even more basic.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:01.580
She considers marriage completely out of the question right now.

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:08.410
Because I thought it necessary, Reishin and I looked through them,

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:10.240
but in the end, it is up to Shuurei.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:14.230
Shuurei will probably find it difficult to make a decision.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:21.810
Anyway, you really take on too many burdens by yourself, Kurou.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:27.040
Trust your brother a bit more.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:39.030
Don't be anxious, the Kou family will be fine.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.290
Brother Shouka, you of all people say that?

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:47.980
In the worst case, I'll live a long time and be head of the family until I'm 100 years old.

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:50.170
I'm prepared for that.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:59.100
By then, there will be a lot of great-grandchildren

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.640
and the next family head can be chosen from many candidates.

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.070
If brother Shou becomes head of the family,

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:05.980
there will be even more trouble for me to deal with.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:11.320
Well, I admit I may have rushed a little about Shuurei,

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:14.440
but my opinion won't change.

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:20.090
A marriage between Shuurei and Kouyuu is the best and only course for the Kou family.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.330
Since Kouyuu is not a fool, he will understand.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.850
You told him about it?

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.290
Including the fact that you brought marriage proposals without our permission?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:29.670
What do you mean "without your permission"?

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:32.500
A marriage between families is always like this.

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:36.540
Goodness, Kouyuu-dono is a serious man.

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:40.600
Given Kurou's character, he probably didn't force the issue,

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.380
but Kurou tends to pressure people unconsciously.

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:50.730
Hmm, but if Kouyuu and Shuurei marry,

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:54.110
then Reishin will be her father-in-law.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.680
Sh-Shuurei will manage that.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:12.880
Who, other than Shuurei, could stand brother Rei as a father-in-law?

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:15.520
W-Well, I guess you're right.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.550
Really, there was no need for the two of you to come along.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.860
Anyway, what do you plan to do at the Merchants Guild?

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:36.480
I want to buy some souvenirs for Shunki and great aunt Eiki.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:42.210
Ah, I see. And what about you, Ryuuren? Why did you come along?

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:46.380
An elegant wind called to me.

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:49.960
I think this century's true masterpiece will be finished soon.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:53.640
This is not good. If he finishes it, he's definitely going to play the flute.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.970
W-Well Ryuuren, why don't you try this for a change?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:14.310
Just now, "Gathering of the White, Evening of Mandarin" has been completed!

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:16.030
What? No way?!

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.380
This mandarin has connected them all.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.530
A big mistake. I tried to distract him.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:25.650
Here.

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:28.120
Just wai-

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:30.670
Ryuuren, what is this-

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:41.670
Well, we're off now.

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:43.670
I'm going to perform my new piece.

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:51.100
I-I'm sorry, Rin-san.

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.220
Ah, don't worry about it.

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:55.440
I'm going to announce our arrival, so please wait here.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:11.230
No matter what, I must win this negotiation.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:23.650
Shuurei-dono.

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.390
Yes, I'm coming.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:30.850
Ah no, actually the executives gave this to me.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:36.740
Honestly, they summoned me because they knew Yuushun wasn't here.

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:40.570
Rin-san...

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:42.520
Shuurei-dono, this is-

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:45.920
I'm going to the palace to see Yuushun-san.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:49.330
Er, ah, wait Shuurei-dono...

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.270
Hakumei-kun?

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.040
It's Hakumei-kun, isn't it?

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:08.420
Wh-What's wrong? Why do you look so worn out?

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:09.150
Oh, it's you.

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:12.650
It's nothing. I just can't finish my work.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:16.290
Hey, wait up! I'll help you.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:20.590
Come to think of it, you're in Civil Affairs, aren't you?

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:23.790
I heard that Kouyuu-sama is in a real state now.

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:29.470
Apparently the Civil Affairs minister is hopeless, always leaving work unfinished.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.760
For your information, the Civil Affairs minister is from your family.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:35.160
What? No, really? It's someone from the Kou family?

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:38.290
You didn't know? He's your-

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:43.390
A mandarin?

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:49.440
Oh, it's a bit damaged. What a waste.

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:53.270
Hey! You're more worried about a mandarin than me?

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:54.310
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:59.060
I don't know who did it, but when I advance in my career,

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.190
I'll make him regret this.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:04.050
You've been keen to make a career from the outset.

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:06.160
Don't you want to?

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:09.350
I do want to succeed. I want to rise...

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:11.070
as far as I can.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:12.440
That goes without saying.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:15.830
It's our job to do so, since we passed the exam at the expense of those who failed.

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:18.410
Well, good luck then.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:22.250
By the way, that little animal, is he well?

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:23.950
Yes, he's fine.

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:31.470
That group called Jyasen-kyou...

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:34.350
It's based on the story of the Sai Hassen, isn't it?

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.060
Yes.

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:40.980
The Eight Sages lived too long and gradually turned into Jya-sen, evil sages,

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.970
and if you didn't worship them, you'd be cursed.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:48.690
Therefore, you must sacrifice regularly and so on and so forth...

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:52.530
These kinds of groups aren't that rare.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.430
Excuse me.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:57.780
Er, an urgent letter has arrived.

00:14:57.780 --> 00:14:58.700
What?

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:05.210
In the neighborhood of Sekiei Village,

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:08.890
the snow foxes were seen at the end of autumn!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:13.720
Eigetsu?!

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:18.310
Umm... Is this related to that unknown illness?

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:22.600
Please call Saisyou-san and ask him

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:27.320
to prepare the medicines and doctors for departure in two days time.

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:33.070
If... If there's a way to treat the illness...

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:37.200
I'll write a letter to Shuurei-san too.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.200
To that young lady?

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:42.420
This illness can be prevented. It's not contagious.

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:47.000
The period of susceptibility to the illness occurs at the end of autumn.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:51.170
In the winter, after a few months of incubation, the symptoms appear.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:57.430
Once a person falls ill, as far as I know, the disease can't be cured.

00:15:57.960 --> 00:16:01.120
It's already winter now! That means...

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:04.180
Yes, that's right. It's probably too late for Sekiei village,

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:07.560
but not for those villages that haven't seen snow foxes.

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:10.320
You said there was no cure.

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:12.230
Not as far as I know.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:17.320
But this is a large country. There may be a doctor who knows a cure for this disease.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.980
The highest chance for this is in Kiyou Palace,

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:23.330
where the best doctors in the country gather.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:28.870
I'll ask Shuurei-san to request the immediate dispatch of the top medics, the ones who attend the Emperor, to our lord.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:31.940
Okay, write the letter now!

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:34.080
We'll make this the top priority for today.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:41.360
Yougetsu, please give me just a little, a fraction more time.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.350
Yuushun-san!

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:57.450
Oh, Shuurei-dono, what nice timing.

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:01.410
A gift for you from someone.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.910
For me?

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:04.830
Who is this from?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:05.500
Er...

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:12.560
You understand? Don't tell her my name.

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:15.490
Just say it's from "a friendly, kind, and charming person."

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:17.040
Got it?!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:25.190
Well, he's weird but not suspicious. Please take it.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:26.970
I don't understand the situation,

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:29.770
but he said, "These taste better than the others."

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:30.870
I see.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:37.660
Why am I encountering so many mandarins today?

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:43.220
Yuushun-san, is the Civil Affairs minister a member of the Kou family?

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.660
Why do you ask?

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:48.820
It seems he's hopeless and doesn't do much work.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:55.710
An uncle from the Kou family is visiting us now.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:18:01.120
Unlike my father, he's a really dependable and splendid person.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:04.980
So I thought that, through my uncle, I could ask the minister to do his job,

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:09.510
but maybe I'm being too pushy.

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:16.430
It's all right, even if you say nothing,

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:21.490
Shuurei-dono's kindness will reach that man very soon.

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:24.130
I think in a couple of days,

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:27.040
the officials in Civil Affairs will be released from their heavy tasks.

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:30.740
For now, let's leave the problems of Civil Affairs aside,

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:33.380
and deal with the Merchants Guild.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:38.580
Yes, but... I just went there with Rin-san,

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:40.650
and I was given this.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:47.900
"We have heard the offer from Sairin.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:51.900
We have no intention of meeting the Governors of Sashuu.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.390
It is not necessary for Tei Yuushun-dono to come either."

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:56.860
I see.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.780
They rejected the offer completely.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:04.240
At this rate, the plan to establish research facilities in Sashuu will...

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.480
Why are you making a face like that?

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:11.540
Our job is finished now.

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:12.620
What?

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:16.440
We won the negotiation with the Merchants Guild without having to fight them.

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:18.520
Now we can go back to Sashuu.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.130
Erm, but, what does that mea-

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:22.260
Excuse me.

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:25.140
Tei Yuushun-sama, please.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.390
Ah, is it time already?

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:30.180
I'm sorry, Shuurei-dono, but I have some errands to do.

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:32.540
That's all for today.

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:35.900
But, Yuushun-san...

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:51.830
Amazing!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.550
You made this all, Uncle Kurou?

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:57.040
I hope you like it.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.550
It's delicious!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:07.050
I also offered to help, but Kurou said no.

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:09.510
I'm glad you didn't help.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:11.560
By the way, where is Ryuuren?

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:14.190
I was walking with him just a little while ago...

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:18.570
There's somewhere I must go.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:22.820
Er, but Ryuuren-san?!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.210
And so he left.

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:30.530
If Ryuuren left without saying farewell,

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:32.020
perhaps something has happened.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.330
He's probably going to turn up somewhere playing his flute.

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:41.380
Oh, come to think of it, I was given this at the palace today.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.800
Wow, that's a delicious-looking mandarin.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.810
I don't believe it. The work is... finished?

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:02.930
It's child's play for a minister of Civil Affairs.

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:07.010
Well done.

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:09.690
Kouyuu-sama!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:12.580
But how come?

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.590
Actually, Kouyuu-sama...

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:20.690
I heard a rumor that the minister of Civil Affairs bought all the mandarins in Kiyou that came from Koushuu.

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:22.240
Mandarins?

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:24.290
Yes, and speaking of mandarins,

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:30.530
when I was talking to Kou Shuurei yesterday, some rude person hit me on the head with a mandarin.

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:37.320
Shuurei, I'm your friendly, kind, and charming uncle.

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:44.770
Let's eat some mandarins for now.

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:45.450
Yes!

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:57.620
Let's see...

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:01.750
Yuushun-san's official residence should be here somewhere.

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:07.070
That letter from the Merchants Guild... He said we won without a fight,

00:22:07.070 --> 00:22:08.670
but I want him to explain it properly to me.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:11.020
It's cold.

00:22:14.220 --> 00:22:16.320
Aw, it started snowing.

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:29.600
A rose petal... in the middle of winter?

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:48.370
Why... can't I move?

00:22:58.310 --> 00:22:59.190
I'm scared.

00:24:45.990 --> 00:24:48.240
A family crest comprised of eight flower petals and a full moon...

00:24:48.860 --> 00:24:50.380
Who is this man?

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:53.710
Why doesn't he look like a normal human being?

00:24:54.290 --> 00:24:57.080
Father? Why are you looking so alarmed?
